\vspace{0.4cm}

{\large\bfseries\color{CoverCream} 關於本書}\qquad{\baskervillefont\itshape\large\color{CoverGoldBright} About This Book}

\vspace{0.4cm}

\begin{minipage}{5in}
\small\color{CoverCream}
$if(backcover)$
$backcover$
$else$
本書分兩卷，寫給剛開始讀舊約的人：不必先學會希伯來文，也可以聰明地使用它。卷一從字母與母音符號開始，經過一個字怎麼組成、基本文法、動詞，到怎樣查一個字才不被「原文」誤導，再用創世記 1:1-5 做一次完整的逐字讀，每隔幾章有一首可以唱的經文；卷二把本系列舊約各卷「原文研讀」裏已經討論過的希伯來文收在一處：全系列一覽、各卷的字，以及依希伯來字母排列的詞目總索引。書中自己計算的次數與統計，都由程式對 OSHB 希伯來文舊約逐詞計算；卷二引用的各卷數字，另用程式重數過。

{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream}\lettrine[lines=3,findent=2pt,nindent=2pt]{\color{CoverGoldBright}A}{}\ two-part book for new Bible students: you do not have to learn Hebrew before you can use it wisely. Part One moves from the alphabet and vowel points, through how a word is built, basic grammar and the verb, to word studies that do not mislead, and ends with a full word-by-word reading of Genesis 1:1-5, with songs along the way. Part Two gathers the Hebrew from the word studies of every Old Testament volume in the series: an overview, a book-by-book section, and an alphabetical index of Hebrew words. Every count the book itself reports is computed from the OSHB text; the counts quoted from the series' own volumes are recounted against it.}
$endif$
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.4cm}

{\small\bfseries\color{CoverCream} 卷一的五站與卷二}\qquad{\baskervillefont\itshape\small\color{CoverGoldBright} Five Stations and Part Two}

