動詞 & 詞幹與形式 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} Stems and forms} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 第 7 章}\\[0.25em]
用 & 查字、數字、逐字讀 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} Word studies and a full reading} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 第 8–10 章}\\[0.25em]
帶著走 & 字彙、工具、十週計劃 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} Vocabulary, tools, a ten-week plan} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 第 11–13 章}\\[0.25em]
卷二 & 各卷的希伯來文：一覽、各卷、詞目總索引 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} Hebrew book by book, with an index} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 卷二}\\
